{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45556","headline":"白雪曲 · 贯休","name":"白雪曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"列鼎佩金章，泪眼看风枝。\n却思食藜藿，身作屠沽儿。\n负米无远近，所希升斗归。\n爲人无贵贱，莫学鸡狗肥。\n斯言如不忘，别更无光辉。\n斯言如或忘，即安用人爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}